  "releaseNotes": "Changed\n\n      Dispatcher<TContext> now requires IContextFactory<TContext> as an explicit constructor dependency.\n\n      The dispatcher no longer resolves IContextFactory<TContext> from IServiceProvider during dispatch.\n\n      Performance\n\n      Removed one IServiceProvider.GetRequiredService call from the dispatch hot path.\n\n      Breaking change\n\n      If you manually instantiate Dispatcher<TContext>, you must now provide an IContextFactory<TContext>.\n\n      Ensure IContextFactory<TContext> is registered in DI (typically Scoped when TContext depends on request-scoped services like HttpContext).",
